# @repo/{{ packageName }}

{{#if description}}{{ description }}{{else}}A plain Drizzle (PostgreSQL) database package.{{/if}}

## Stack

- `drizzle-orm/bun-sql` — Drizzle adapter that uses Bun's built-in `SQL` client (no separate driver dep).
- `createDb(url)` opens a Postgres connection and returns a typed Drizzle instance.

## Environment

- `DATABASE_URL` — Postgres connection string. The package does not read this on its own; pass it to `createDb()`. drizzle-kit reads it directly via `process.env`.

## Scripts

- `bun run build` — TypeScript build to `dist/`
- `bun run check` — biome lint + `tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.test.json`
- `bun test` — runs an import-only smoke test
- `bun run db:generate` — generate migrations from `src/schema.ts` into `drizzle/`
- `bun run db:migrate` — apply pending migrations against `DATABASE_URL`
- `bun run db:push` — push schema directly (development only)
- `bun run db:studio` — open Drizzle Studio against `DATABASE_URL`

## Adding tables

Edit `src/schema.ts` using `drizzle-orm/pg-core`, then run `bun run db:generate`.
